.TH CRUNCH_SYSFS_INDEX 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_sysfs_index \- look up a filesystem type index
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/legacy_syscalls.h>
.B int crunch_sysfs_index(const char *name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uses the obsolete Linux sysfs syscall to look up a filesystem type by name.
Availability and permissions depend on the kernel.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the index, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crunch_sysfs (3crunch),
.BR sysfs (2)
